  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TuvaluTIPS Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EIF Funded Tuvalu Trade and Integrated Private Sector Development Project (Tuvalu TIPS) with the aim to assist Tuvalu Government in achieving goals of Te Kakeega III (TKIII), the National Strategy for Sustainable Development, which are aimed at trade and private sector development in Tuvalu, with specific interventions to improve/increase: (i)	business environment (trade/industry/investment policy); (ii)	private sector development (business incubator, promote SMEs/women in business, support outer islands businesses), (iii)	export &amp; income opportunities in selected productive sectors of the economy (agriculture, fisheries and tourism). The main expected result of the project is to &#x2018;enhance trade and private sector capacities in Tuvalu&#x2019;</narrative>
  </description>
